@startuml
title A private swap — the note is opened in private and closed at the public price
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #4A78B5
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EEF5FF
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #4A78B5
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #EEF5FF
skinparam ActorBorderColor #4A78B5
skinparam LifelineBorderColor #4A78B5
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #F5F9FF
skinparam noteBorderColor #4A78B5

actor Alice
participant "PXE\n(private execution)" as PXE
participant "AMM\ncontract" as AMM
participant "Token out\ncontract" as T2
participant "Sequencer\n(public execution)" as PUB

== Private phase, on Alice's device ==
Alice -> PXE : swap 100 of token1 for token2
PXE -> AMM : swap_private(...)
AMM -> T2 : initialize_transfer_commitment(\n  to = alice, completer = amm)
T2 -> T2 : partial = H(alice, randomness)\nwrite H(partial, amm) to the nullifier tree
T2 --> AMM : commitment (a Field)
note over PXE, T2 #F5F9FF
  The output amount cannot be computed here.
  The exchange rate is public state, and private
  execution runs before the sequencer touches
  the block. Only the payee is fixed.
end note
AMM -> AMM : debit Alice's private\ntoken1 balance
AMM -> PUB : enqueue the public half

== Public phase, on the sequencer ==
PUB -> AMM : _complete_swap(commitment, amount_in)
AMM -> AMM : read the reserves,\ncompute amount_out
AMM -> T2 : transfer_public_to_commitment(\n  commitment, amount_out)
T2 -> T2 : check H(partial, msg_sender)\nexists, then complete
T2 -> T2 : note_hash = H(slot, partial, amount_out)\ninserted into the note hash tree
note over T2, PUB #F5F9FF
  Public completion emits the value in a public
  log, so the amount is visible. Alice's identity
  is not: it stays inside the partial commitment.
end note
T2 --> Alice : PXE matches the completion log\nand the note becomes spendable
@enduml
